## Best Practices

1. Always check error responses in your API calls
2. Implement proper error handling for all possible error codes
3. Log errors appropriately for debugging purposes
4. Use try-catch blocks when working with potentially error-prone operations

## Error Response Format

All API endpoints return error responses in the following format:

```json
{
    "success": false,
    "error": {
        "code": "ERROR_CODE",
        "message": "Detailed error message",
        "details": {
            "additional": "error specific information"
        }
    }
}
```
